## Why This Is Asked

A practical bit-hacking task that validates understanding of bit propagation without loops.

## Key Concepts

- Bitwise shifts
- In-place masking
- Deterministic results for edge cases (x=0)

## Code Example

```javascript
uint32_t spanMask32(uint32_t x) {
  x |= x >> 1;
  x |= x >> 2;
  x |= x >> 4;
  x |= x >> 8;
  x |= x >> 16;
  return x;
}
```

